  partName: Rear Blade Shroud 2
  description: The Rear Blade Shroud 2 is a thin, flat component situated at the
    middle-center-rear of the engine, crafted from Blades2 material. Like the Rear
    Blade Shroud 1, it provides a protective casing for the Rear Blade 2, ensuring
    a smooth airflow and minimizing obstruction. Its identical design to the Rear
    Blade Shroud 1 underscores the engine's emphasis on symmetry and balance in its
    design.
